1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:07,168
In the hills of the Dominican Republic, small farms grow much of the country's food.

2
00:00:07,168 --> 00:00:11,554
But pests and diseases can take up to forty percent of a harvest,

3
00:00:11,554 --> 00:00:14,590
and where the signal stops, help is far away.

4
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:19,110
Meet Conuco: a field assistant for those farmers,

5
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:22,421
on the web in Chrome and as a native Android app.

6
00:00:22,421 --> 00:00:27,690
It turns the weather into clear daily decisions, and it keeps working offline.

7
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,330
Conuco is built on Firebase.

8
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:38,362
Firebase AI Logic runs hybrid inference: Gemini Nano on the device first,

9
00:00:38,362 --> 00:00:41,326
and Gemini in the cloud only when it helps.

10
00:00:41,326 --> 00:00:45,600
Remote Config tunes the confidence floor and the models, live.

11
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:50,770
Authentication and Firestore keep every farm log private and offline-first.

12
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:56,560
And App Check, with Play Integrity and reCAPTCHA Enterprise, protects every AI call.

13
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:06,860
Now, the crop doctor. On Android, the big camera button opens a leaf camera,

14
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:12,050
with a frame and live checks for blur and light, before the photo is taken.

15
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,456
On a laptop with Gemini Nano, Chrome runs the diagnosis right on the device.

16
00:01:18,456 --> 00:01:23,122
The photo is redrawn first, so location and camera data are gone.

17
00:01:23,122 --> 00:01:28,650
Nano answers with an honest confidence. On this device, the photo never left.

18
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:36,798
This phone has no Gemini Nano, so Conuco asks before anything leaves.

19
00:01:36,798 --> 00:01:40,788
With a yes, Gemini in the cloud answers in seconds:

20
00:01:40,788 --> 00:01:44,230
Black Sigatoka, severe, ninety-five percent.

21
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,363
Every step becomes a task with one tap.

22
00:01:49,363 --> 00:01:56,024
The advice is filtered: no pesticide doses, and a reminder to check with an extension officer.

23
00:01:56,024 --> 00:02:03,748
One tap warns the neighbours: the report lands on the outbreak map as an eleven-kilometre area, never a farm.

24
00:02:03,748 --> 00:02:08,070
And each morning, Today turns it all into one clear decision.

25
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:34,313
Conuco. The device first, the cloud only with consent, on the web and on Android.

26
00:02:34,313 --> 00:02:38,990
Built with Firebase, for the farmers where the signal stops.

27
00:02:38,990 --> 00:02:41,640
Try it today at petiht.com/conuco.

